{"updated":"2026-11-26T04:35:11.473Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DgGtI_0gCu9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgGtI_0gCu9","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini Carbon high","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:49:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgGoLrPkzmd","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgGoLrPkzmd","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini額度又重置了\npro用戶也能使用Carbon了\n現在黑五年訂閱半價一個月不到300元\n真的訂閱起來","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:05:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DgKsgRcihJE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKsgRcihJE","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"『前男友的婚禮，我是不會去的』\n\n上個月突然接到一個電話\n陌生的號碼，接起來是熟悉又陌生的聲音\n是分手好幾年的前男友\n原本以為該不是那種求復合的爛戲碼\n\n「現在來找我，是要幹嘛?」\n「…….」\n他沉默了一下\n「我要結婚了，我想邀請你」\n\n我們是從高中到大三在一起的\n有過很多青春甜蜜的回憶\n後來因為一些事就分手沒再聯絡\n但我還是看在以往的感情上答應了。\n\n「好，我會去」\n「對了!你未婚妻知道我和你的關係嗎?」\n「知道阿，阿，她在找我了，\n之後婚禮上再聊，掰」\n\n到的婚禮當天我沒去\n我請我們以前的同學轉交紅包並說\n\n「這6000塊，\n是祝福你們的，\n畢竟婚禮開銷很大，\n也是感謝你曾經帶給我很多美好的回憶。\n\n我沒去，是我對新娘的尊重，\n我不知道她知道我多少，\n但看到和自己老公曾經很深愛的女人出現，\n她一定會有疙瘩。\n\n最後，以後我結婚了，\n我不會發你喜帖，\n因為我也想保護我現在的男友。」","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:00:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":12,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":20,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKsiaRCqGZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKsiaRCqGZ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B5：我覺得原Po的態度真的很棒\n我知道過去的感情可能真的很深刻很深刻\n所以你願意包6000祝福他\n但有時真的要多照顧兩邊的現任\n不要讓前女友陪老婆挑婚紗\n你兩邊都顧到了，給你大大的讚","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:00:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKskEFipeD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKskEFipeD","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B9：可是如果我是新娘我會希望他的前女友能來欸😂\n對我來說來參加婚禮就是祝福\n我完全不忌諱前女友","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:01:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKsl0BiieV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKsl0BiieV","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B3：6000太多了吧！！！\n看來妳對他真的很好，都處處想著他…","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:01:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKiyMJijNP","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKiyMJijNP","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"11/28就是投票日啦！！\n你準備好了嗎🗳️","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:38:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKjEMuGEE6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKjEMuGEE6","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"如果沒帶印章的話還能投票嗎🧐？\n「這些」投票小知識很重要\n趕快先來練習你的投票日🔥👉dcard.link/k68xc…","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:38:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKeyu7D0Ue","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKeyu7D0Ue","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"『我要發瘋 撞見我弟叫他女友媽媽= =』\n\n中午到家發現我弟在家\n要回我房間會經過他房間\n就聽到有人說「媽媽⋯」的撒嬌聲音\n我以為我媽今天沒上班就敲門問媽媽在裡面嗎？\n他回我不是 但他有帶女友回來\n現在就越想越不對= =\n他是把他女友叫媽媽是嗎⋯⋯\n這麼說來他女友甚至比我們\n（我24 我弟22）還老（她28）\n我要發瘋\n以後我弟叫我們真正的媽媽時我一定會想到這件事⋯⋯","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:00:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":17,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":25,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKez5wjyiV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKez5wjyiV","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","cont