ame":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"內容工廠流程上線後，\n一個半月，社群多了六萬人追蹤，粉絲數成長十倍！！🔥🚀\n\nFB: 3千 -> 突破 3 萬！\nIG: 800 -> 突破 1.2 萬！\nYoutube: 3000 -> 突破 2.4萬！\n\n沒想到英國唸碩班同時佛系經營懶人報，一開始為了解決自己FOMO痛點的小頻道，到現在可以有那麼多人有興趣，對這麼多人產生價值，即使是 AI 做的，但只要內容有料，大家還是很愛看的！！\n\n我沒有特別厲害，但我做的AI內容工廠很厲害！！\n\n不管你是經營什麼內容，不可避免的事，未來的熱點搜尋，內容製作，影片剪輯，發布，肯定都會需要 AI + 自動化的輔助，也只有當你把流程做成可持續的系統，才能讓你走得長久！\n\n拆解影片放留言👇","timestamp":"2026-11-26T02:11:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":37},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgMAJuIkmF9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgMAJuIkmF9","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"如果你好奇我是怎麼做的  歡迎參考我這隻拆解影片唷～\nyoutube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-11-26T02:11:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":3},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgMA6s8EvAf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgMA6s8EvAf","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"課程連結： portaly.cc/ailrb…","timestamp":"2026-11-26T02:18:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgLxF1Bk5A7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgLxF1Bk5A7","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"最近也有想來玩玩更多不同的AI影片，看到有人幫蔣萬安做了主題曲超夯，只能說角色一致性，節奏，音樂的搭配都太猛了！！！內容也太真實了🤣\n\n持續學習🔥🔥","timestamp":"2026-11-25T23:59:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHFNTao_cC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgHFNTao_cC","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"可喜可賀🔥🔥\n\nAI懶人報拆解課程，上線五天突破30人付費支持了🥹 超過13萬台幣進帳，也有很多人給我鼓勵與五星好評，還是一樣，感恩的心♥️，謝謝大家的喜歡，對我來說把自己的流程分享出來包裝成數位產品，本身就是一種新鮮的學習體驗，賺多少錢我並不是太在意，但看到自己的內容有人願意付費支持，能幫助到有需要的人，也走了一趟AI課程從規劃，製作，優化，上架，行銷的過程，我自己才是受惠最多的人🫶\n\n這幾天帶家人來日本玩，好好放鬆一下，也恭喜老黃王者歸來，太神啦!!","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:19:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":149,"replies":21,"reposts":5,"shares":41},"score":206,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DgK4894H3kO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgK4894H3kO","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"今天企業內訓講到 Gemini 4 模型\n：同學們，上化學課囉\n氫、鋰、鈉、鉀、銣、銫、鍅\n\n小道消息：\n連新的 banana 模型也是另一個化學元素…","timestamp":"2026-11-25T15:49:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":18,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgIQ_ORH7xK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgIQ_ORH7xK","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"MCP 之亂\nCanva 也推出 MCP 了！\n\n雖然 可能 已經有不少人沒在用 Canva \n但這次推出還是蠻轟動的\n\n也就是說以前存在 Canva 的很多模板\n現在都能交給 Claude 直接做編輯跟調整\n兩者合併能提高不少產圖的美感跟效率\n\n像是你覺得 Claude 做的圖有點怪\n就能自己打開 Canva 微調一下位置跟改字\n能節省 token 又非常省時\n再請 Claude 記下跟學習這次的調整就好","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:21:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":153,"replies":5,"reposts":9,"shares":50},"score":190,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgISGBDD6Bo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgISGBDD6Bo","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"安裝教學連結：\ncanva.dev/docs…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:31:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":13,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHtiBSlG-s","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHtiBSlG-s","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Meta Edits 最神的\n當然是內建 MCP 讓 AI 來幫你剪片\n\n除以之外還有很多影片相關功能：\n→ 上字幕、加特效、影片之間的轉場\n→ 4K 匯出沒有浮水印\n→ 內建音樂庫和音效\n→ 支援提詞機錄音跟雙語自動字幕\n→ 連 LUTs 和 Apple Log 還原都能做到\n\n以上這些除了你可以自己調整\nAI 也能直接幫你做完\n\n最後一頁可以看看 AI 自己排完的四軌時間軸\n想試 Mac 免費剪片的話可以直接載來玩玩看！","timestamp":"2026-11-24T10:12:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":128,"replies":7,"reposts":14,"shares":93},"score":184,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHKPGbEdr1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHKPGbEdr1","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google 大佛心\n\n終於把 Carbon 下放給 Pro 用戶了\n而且 Argon 那條獨立的 Usage 也合併\n最近也會沒事就重置一下\n\n至於是否推薦後面黑五直上年繳方案\n我覺得要看你願不願意想花三千塊\n很難保證 Google 是都只會在 Q4 才發力\n還是明年一整年都能維持很有競爭力","timestamp":"2026-11-24T05:03:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":72,"replies":16,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":107,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[{"id":"DgIflVTEpvz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@c.yu.an_/post/DgIflVTEpvz","username":"c.yu.an_","displayName":"c.yu.an_","content":"都不是小伙子了 這種白痴錯誤還是會發生","timestamp":"2026-11-24T17:29:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DgFzSaplAOx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DgFzSaplAOx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"Rrrrrr! Jensen is back 🥲🥲🥲\n痛哭","timestamp":"2026-11-23T16:23:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}